WEBVTT

00:07:59.218 --> 00:08:03.401
just ask anybody who runs
a movie studio or a music label.

00:08:04.001 --> 00:08:06.973
So now maybe in 2026,

00:08:06.997 --> 00:08:09.202
it would take a true genius
like our virologist

00:08:09.226 --> 00:08:11.847
to make the actual living critter,

00:08:11.871 --> 00:08:13.797
but 15 years later,

00:08:13.821 --> 00:08:17.414
it may just take a DNA printer
you can find at any high school.

00:08:17.883 --> 00:08:19.065
And if not?

00:08:19.514 --> 00:08:21.462
Give it a couple of decades.

00:08:22.248 --> 00:08:24.658
So, a quick aside:

00:08:24.682 --> 00:08:25.924
Remember this slide here?

00:08:25.948 --> 00:08:28.267
Turn your attention to these two words.

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:35.120
If somebody tries this
and is only 0.1 percent effective,